            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2034. Beneath the ruins of post-apocalyptic Moscow, in the tunnels of the Metro, the remnants of mankind are besieged by deadly threats from outside – and within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutants stalk the catacombs beneath the desolate surface, and hunt amidst the poisoned skies above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But rather than stand united, the station-cities of the Metro are locked in a struggle for the ultimate power, a doomsday device from the military vaults of D6. A civil war is stirring that could wipe humanity from the face of the earth forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Artyom, burdened by guilt but driven by hope, you hold the key to our survival – the last light in our darkest hour…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATED FOR STEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the post-apocalyptic depths of the Moscow Metro like never before with the Next-Gen Update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METRO Last Light Redux has been enhanced with numerous visual and technical improvements, including 4K Textures; TSR, DLSS and FSR support; increased Geometry and Texture details; improved PBR materials; spatial audio support; improved Animations and sound quality, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METRO Last Light Redux also adds supports for the Xbox Controller Impulse Triggers and DualSense controller Adaptive Triggers, immersing you further in the fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METRO Last Light Redux continues Artyom’s epic journey in this definitive version – experience the 2013 classic, rebuilt in 2014 and now further updated to take advantage of modern hardware while preserving the gameplay of the original Redux experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the horrors of the apocalypse, and immerse yourself in the Moscow Metro – equip your gasmask and an arsenal of hand-made weaponry as you face the threat of deadly mutants, human foes, and supernatural phenomena in one of the most atmospheric worlds in gaming </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two unique Play Styles : ‘Spartan’ and ‘Survival’ – approach the campaign as a slow burn Survival Horror , or tackle it with the combat skills of a Spartan Ranger in these two unique modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary Ranger Mode returns – dare you play the fearsome Ranger Mode? No HUD, UI, deadlier combat and limited resources combine to create the ultimate immersive experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the internationally bestselling novel series by Dmitry Glukhovsky</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2034. Beneath the ruins of post-apocalyptic Moscow, in the tunnels of the Metro, the remnants of mankind are besieged by deadly threats from outside – and within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutants stalk the catacombs beneath the desolate surface, and hunt amidst the poisoned skies above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But rather than stand united, the station-cities of the Metro are locked in a struggle for the ultimate power, a doomsday device from the military vaults of D6. A civil war is stirring that could wipe humanity from the face of the earth forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Artyom, burdened by guilt but driven by hope, you hold the key to our survival – the last light in our darkest hour…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATED FOR STEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the post-apocalyptic depths of the Moscow Metro like never before with the Next-Gen Update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METRO Last Light Redux has been enhanced with numerous visual and technical improvements, including 4K Textures; TSR, DLSS and FSR support; increased Geometry and Texture details; improved PBR materials; spatial audio support; improved Animations and sound quality, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METRO Last Light Redux also adds supports for the Xbox Controller Impulse Triggers and DualSense controller Adaptive Triggers, immersing you further in the fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METRO Last Light Redux continues Artyom’s epic journey in this definitive version – experience the 2013 classic, rebuilt in 2014 and now further updated to take advantage of modern hardware while preserving the gameplay of the original Redux experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the horrors of the apocalypse, and immerse yourself in the Moscow Metro – equip your gasmask and an arsenal of hand-made weaponry as you face the threat of deadly mutants, human foes, and supernatural phenomena in one of the most atmospheric worlds in gaming </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two unique Play Styles : ‘Spartan’ and ‘Survival’ – approach the campaign as a slow burn Survival Horror , or tackle it with the combat skills of a Spartan Ranger in these two unique modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary Ranger Mode returns – dare you play the fearsome Ranger Mode? No HUD, UI, deadlier combat and limited resources combine to create the ultimate immersive experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the internationally bestselling novel series by Dmitry Glukhovsky</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "It is the year 2034. Beneath the ruins of post-apocalyptic Moscow, in the tunnels of the Metro, the remnants of mankind are besieged by deadly threats from outside – and within. Mutants stalk the catacombs beneath the desolate surface, and hunt amidst the poisoned skies above.",
